{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52447","headline":"回波乐 九十 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今得入新年，合家蒙喜庆。\n人人皆发愿，远离时气病。\n岁日食他肉，肉是他家命。\n今朝入新年，昨暮煞他命（一作「煞他竞」）。\n论时大罪过，食肉身招病。\n一则自短命（一作「寿」），二则（一作「即」）还他命。\n负债早还却，门前无諠竞。\n怨怨来相雠，何时解适（项校「释」）竟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}